令：列侯的太夫人、夫人、诸侯王的儿子以及二千石官吏，不得擅自征捕他人。","content_jianti_auto":"1冬，十月，令列侯太夫人、夫人、诸侯王子及吏二千石无得擅征捕。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1146,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d71b-db0e-11ef-bda4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2夏，四月，赦天下。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月，大赦天下。","content_jianti_auto":"2夏，四月，赦天下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1147,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d71e-db0e-11ef-82b2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"如淳","people_name_jianti_auto":"如淳","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d721-db0e-11ef-ad16-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉灼","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋灼","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d722-db0e-11ef-a829-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d723-db0e-11ef-aab8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"崔豹","people_name_jianti_auto":"崔豹","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d724-db0e-11ef-b51b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔穎達","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔颖达","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d725-db0e-11ef-a6b8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蘇鶚","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏鹗","start_index":219,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d726-db0e-11ef-a955-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蘇鶚","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏鹗","start_index":261,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d727-db0e-11ef-b837-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d728-db0e-11ef-8001-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d729-db0e-11ef-9716-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":269,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d72a-db0e-11ef-b3e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":276,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d72b-db0e-11ef-8c90-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"如淳曰：東闕與其兩旁罘罳皆災也。晉灼曰：東闕之罘罳獨災也。師古曰：罘罳，謂連闕曲閣也，以覆重刻垣墉處，其形罘罳然。一曰：屛也。崔豹古今註曰：罘罳，屛也。又云：罘者，復也；罳者，思也；臣朝君至屛外，復思所奏之事於其下。孔穎達曰：屛謂之樹，今浮思也；釋宮文。漢時謂屛爲浮思，解者以爲天子外屛；人臣至屛，俯伏思念其事。按匠人：城隅謂角浮思也。漢時東闕浮思災，以此諸文參之，則浮思小樓也，故城隅、闕上皆有之。然則屛上亦爲屋以覆屛牆，故稱屛曰浮思。蘇鶚演義曰：罘者，浮也；罳者，思也；謂織絲之文輕疏虛浮之貌，蓋宮殿門闕有此物也。余謂蘇鶚之說，有見於唐禁中之罘罳；唐太和甘露之變，宦者奉乘輿、決罘罳北出者也。此罘罳當以舊註爲正。","note_content_jianti_auto":"如淳曰：东阙与其两旁罘罳皆灾也。晋灼曰：东阙之罘罳独灾也。师古曰：罘罳，谓连阙曲阁也，以覆重刻垣墉处，其形罘罳然。一曰：屛也。崔豹古今注曰：罘罳，屛也。又云：罘者，复也；罳者，思也；臣朝君至屛外，复思所奏之事于其下。孔颖达曰：屛谓之树，今浮思也；释宫文。汉时谓屛为浮思，解者以为天子外屛；人臣至屛，俯伏思念其事。按匠人：城隅谓角浮思也。汉时东阙浮思灾，以此诸文参之，则浮思小楼也，故城隅、阙上皆有之。然则屛上亦为屋以覆屛墙，故称屛曰浮思。苏鹗演义曰：罘者，浮也；罳者，思也；谓织丝之文轻疏虚浮之貌，盖宫殿门阙有此物也。余谓苏鹗之说，有见于唐禁中之罘罳；唐太和甘露之变，宦者奉乘舆、决罘罳北出者也。此罘罳当以旧注为正。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d720-db0e-11ef-b1f2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8ee0d71f-db0e-11ef-8f7e-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"fú","source_anchor_text":"央宮東闕罘罳災民有","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":12,"text":"罘","tongjian_id":"33dcbf74-0e07-573e-8cb1-dbc57eaf81db"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8ee0d71f-db0e-11ef-8f7e-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"sī","source_anchor_text":"宮東闕罘罳災民有歌","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":13,"text":"罳","tongjian_id":"84674ef4-288e-5c77-ac07-719d8e7810d1"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"未央宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"未央宫","resolved_place_entity_id":782,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d730-db0e-11ef-b153-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3六月，癸酉，未央宮東闕罘罳災。","content_fanyi":"六月癸酉日，未央宫东阙的罘罳发生火灾。","content_jianti_auto":"3六月，癸酉，未央宫东阙罘罳灾。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1148,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d71f-db0e-11ef-8f7e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"臣瓚","people_name_jianti_auto":"臣瓒","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d733-db0e-11ef-8e22-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"臣瓚曰：一尺布可縫而共衣，一斗粟可舂而共食，況以天下之廣，而兄弟不相容乎！","note_content_jianti_auto":"臣瓒曰：一尺布可缝而共衣，一斗粟可舂而共食，况以天下之广，而兄弟不相容乎！","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d732-db0e-11ef-98d2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-198,"link_death_year":-174,"link_td_description":"刘长，是汉高祖刘邦的第7个儿子，由刘邦女婿张敖所献的美人赵姬所生，被封为淮南王，因谋反，被汉文帝流放蜀郡而死，谥曰淮南厉王。","link_td_id":"Q10004256","link_td_number_id":546144,"people_name":"淮南王","people_name_jianti_auto":"淮南王","people_xingming":"刘长","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d734-db0e-11ef-837e-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘长]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/淮南王","excerpts":[{"context_after":"曰：“一尺布，尚可缝。一斗粟，尚可舂，兄弟二人不相容。”...","context_before":"","source_end_index":14,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a5c5ae0c-ddd9-43ab-b64b-5559de1cf487","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"汉淮南厉王死，民作歌以讽文帝"}],"path":"续笔/卷七/淮南王","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["权争"],"content":"4民有歌淮南王者曰：「一尺布，尚可縫；一斗粟，尚可舂；兄弟二人不相容！」帝聞而病之。","content_fanyi":"民间有人唱关于淮南王的歌说：“一尺布，尚可缝；一斗粟，尚可舂；兄弟二人不相容！”文帝听说后为此忧虑。","content_jianti_auto":"4民有歌淮南王者曰：「一尺布，尚可缝；一斗粟，尚可舂；兄弟二人不相容！」帝闻而病之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，况下此者！于是而曹丕、刘彧、高湛、陈蒨，自不欲全其本支...","context_before":"呜呼！","source_end_index":21,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ebe6d37f-4978-42a3-8223-25b34377d7d0","source_start_index":3,"source_text":"汉文帝之贤也，且以尺布斗粟致不容之怨"}],"title":"一 钱氏孝友传家保世绵永"}],"id":1149,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d731-db0e-11ef-85ae-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"七年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"七年","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8ee0d719-db0e-11ef-a886-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（戊辰、前一七三）","year_int":-173},"message":"success","success":true}